  "slug": "rhubarb-strawberry-jam",
  "name": "Strawberry Rhubarb Jam with Jell-O",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "This strawberry rhubarb jam is made with strawberry-flavored Jell-O and fresh rhubarb for a super easy jam recipe that's sure to become a favorite.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a large saucepan or stockpot, stir together the fresh rhubarb and sugar. Cover, and let stand overnight."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Bring the rhubarb and sugar to a boil over medium heat. Boil, stirring constantly, for 12 minutes on low heat. Remove from heat, and stir in dry gelatin mix. Transfer to sterile jars, and refrigerate."
    }
  ],
